      "mergeID": "5b660f70fa044b33688794d5",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Right now it's possible to vote-kick a world creator out of their own world. This was used by a group to \"hijack\" a public instance of my world and prevented me from being able to appropriately moderate and control the experience in my world. World creators should be immune from vote-kicking while in any instance of their own world.",
